          "quote": "请尽快带上您手头所有旧检查单（即使看不清日期），前往医院肾内科或泌尿外科就诊"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 requires organizing materials into clinically meaningful groups, giving specific instructions that solve actual barriers (glare, foreign box, multiple document types), offering fallback sources, and assigning ownership/timing. The doctor does all of these: groups medicines, CT conclusions, gynecology orders, and fever/urine records; provides specific photo instructions (avoid reflection, include full page/date/conclusion); and assigns the patient to bring physical packages and records to an in-person visit. This goes well beyond a generic 'send clearer photos' and is completed with meaningful trajectory impact.",
